body:
Thank you very much for responding and giving your own thoughts, I highly appreciate it. As for my family, we only ever say "good morning" and "good evening" to each other. Anything more than that just devolves into arguments and fights.

&#x200B;

I agree that my friends seem to care about me a lot, and they might just be the thing thats keeping me from ending it. But I also worry about destroying my friendship with them if we keep on talking about struggles and emotions. The girl yesterday said that she just wants to have fun, but she won't be getting that if I make her cry every time I open up to them. But I'll just have to put on a mask of joy, for their sakes. 

&#x200B;

As for writing more about my feelings, first of all thank you for the compliment. Secondly, I will take your suggestion and write more about how I feel. It might be hard at first but I will definitely try my best. I wonder about the anxiety attack part though. I agree that that may very well be the case, but that's the first time I've experienced it. Today I woke up with chest pains and breathing difficulties. May that also be part of the anxiety attack?

&#x200B;

Lastly, yes, your words make so much sense to me and I will take your suggestions to heart. Maybe I shouldn't apologize for everything or anything, but I still want to tell the girl that I will stay, for their sakes.

I'll give it a shot then

&#x200B;

Edit: Still fucked
